sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant PER001 as PER-001 Customer
    participant APP as SVC-017 Digital Channels
    participant SVC013 as SVC-013 Fraud Detection
    participant EVTBUS as SVC-102 Event Bus
    participant SVC001 as SVC-001 Retail Banking Core
    participant SVC009 as SVC-009 Domestic Payments
    participant SVC053 as SVC-053 Notification Service
    participant SVC111 as SVC-111 WORM Store
    participant PER054 as PER-054 Fraud Analyst
    participant PAYUK as Pay.UK Reimbursement API

    Note over PER001,PAYUK: PH-064 — Fraud Alert Trigger

    PER001->>APP: Select suspect payment, submit fraud report
    APP->>SVC013: POST /fraud-cases (trigger_type=customer_report)
    SVC013->>SVC013: Create FraudCase status=open. Publish FraudCaseCreated (EVT-090)
    SVC013-->>APP: 201 Created — {case_id, case_reference=APP-20260415-000123}
    APP-->>PER001: Case reference confirmed. Decision within 5 business days
    SVC013-)SVC053: Dispatch case confirmation (push + email)

    Note over PER001,PAYUK: PH-065 — Case Creation (within 4 hours)

    PER054->>SVC013: GET /fraud-cases/{id} — open from analyst queue
    Note over SVC013,EVTBUS: Cross-capability async: CAP-004 → CAP-001 and CAP-003 via Event Bus
    SVC013-)EVTBUS: Publish FraudDataRequested (payment_intent_id)
    EVTBUS-)SVC001: SVC-001 consumes FraudDataRequested — retrieves PaymentIntent
    SVC001-)EVTBUS: Publish FraudDataProvided (£12,500, cop_result=match, fraud_risk_level=medium)
    EVTBUS-)SVC013: SVC-013 consumes FraudDataProvided
    EVTBUS-)SVC009: SVC-009 consumes FraudDataRequested — retrieves PaymentExecution
    SVC009-)EVTBUS: Publish FraudPaymentExecutionProvided (fps_reference=FPS2026..., receiving_sort_code=200000)
    EVTBUS-)SVC013: SVC-013 consumes FraudPaymentExecutionProvided
    PER054->>SVC013: POST /fraud-cases/{id}/evidence (evidence_type=transaction_data)
    SVC013->>SVC013: Create FraudEvidence. PATCH status=investigating. Publish FraudInvestigationStarted (EVT-091)
    SVC013-)SVC053: Dispatch investigation started notification to PER-001

    Note over PER001,PAYUK: PH-066 — Investigation

    PER054->>SVC013: POST /fraud-cases/{id}/evidence (evidence_type=device_data)
    PER054->>SVC013: PATCH /fraud-cases/{id} (vulnerability_assessment=[elderly])
    PER054->>SVC013: POST /fraud-cases/{id}/evidence (evidence_type=vulnerability_assessment_record)
    PER054->>SVC013: PATCH /fraud-cases/{id} (status=decision_pending)

    Note over PER001,PAYUK: PH-067 — Reimbursement Decision (within 5 business days total)

    PER054->>SVC013: POST /fraud-cases/{id}/decision (decision=approve, reimbursement_amount=12500)
    SVC013->>SVC013: Update FraudCase status=reimbursed. Publish FraudReimbursementApproved (EVT-092)
    SVC013-)SVC053: Dispatch regulated outcome letter (approve) to PER-001

    Note over PER001,PAYUK: PH-068 — Reimbursement Execution (P99 < 30min from EVT-092)

    SVC001-)SVC001: Consume EVT-092. Credit £12,500 to Account. Publish ReimbursementCredited (EVT-094)
    SVC001-)SVC053: Dispatch credit confirmation
    SVC053-)PER001: Push: £12,500 APP Fraud Reimbursement credited
    SVC009-)SVC009: Consume EVT-092. Create ReimbursementClaim (sending_share=£6,250, receiving_share=£6,250)

    Note over PER001,PAYUK: PH-069 — Recovery (independent of 5-day SLA)

    SVC009->>PAYUK: Submit recovery claim (receiving_bank_share=£6,250)
    PAYUK-->>SVC009: Claim reference PAYUK-CLAIM-20260415-001
    SVC009->>SVC009: Publish RecoveryInitiated (EVT-095)
    PAYUK-)SVC009: [~15 business days] Receiving PSP returns £6,250
    SVC009->>SVC009: Update ReimbursementClaim recovery_status=full. Publish RecoveryCompleted (EVT-096)

    Note over PER001,PAYUK: PH-070 — Case Closure

    PER054->>SVC013: PATCH /fraud-cases/{id} (status=closed)
    SVC013->>SVC013: Set closed_at. Publish FraudCaseClosed (EVT-097). Publish FraudPatternDetected (EVT-098)
    SVC013-)SVC111: Archive FraudCase + FraudEvidence to WORM (7-year retention)
    SVC013-)SVC053: Dispatch case closure notification
